@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Korean name candidates (503 when GEMINI_API_KEY is absent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/names/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ja_name": "田中 陽子"}

### Given name only
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/names/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ja_name": "陽子"}

### Empty name: 422 invalid_ja_name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/names/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ja_name": ""}
